  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp; be the solution curve of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math> is equal to :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
